Subject: [PATCH] USERSTORY PGO/LTO/BOLT pipeline adaptation

Issue:
------
he current automated packaging pipeline does not include the PGO-optimized version.

Solution:
---------
Adapt the release workflow so that the release pipeline, Fuxi, and access control can carry the PGO version package.
